---
date: 2026-06-24
title: Introducing the changelog
summary: A running log of what's new in AnimoRank, starting with this week's updates.
---

We're starting a changelog. From now on, this page is where new features, fixes,
and improvements get written down as they ship, so you can always see what
changed and when.

**Added**

- A Frequently Asked Questions page covering accounts, problem sets, and grading.

**Improved**

- Jumping to a section now scrolls smoothly instead of snapping into place.
- The landing page now adapts to phones and tablets.
